  "description": "Binary Subarrays With Sum (LeetCode 930) explained: count subarrays with sum exactly goal as atMost(goal) - atMost(goal - 1) with a sliding window, O(n) time, O(1) space, plus the prefix-sum count map, in Go, C++, Java, Python.",
  "hero": {
