      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window (exactly k = at most k - at most k-1)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/binary-subarrays-with-sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 930</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Binary Subarrays With Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Zeros make \"sum exactly goal\" impossible to count with one window, but \"sum at most goal\" is easy: every start from the left edge on works. So answer = atMost(goal) - atMost(goal - 1). O(n) time, O(1) space; a prefix-sum count map also works in O(n) space.</p>\n"
  },
